ensitive topic to the attention of the  council and finally I'm looking forward  to celebrating the third edition of the  be inclusive we use four  was tonight together with Minister  Hosono handing out awards for nine  outstanding projects this initiative  which I launched in 2017 highlights and  rewards people and organizations using  the power of sport to bring people  together and build communities thank you  very much Thank You commissioner so the  floor is now open for questions  please kindly mention your name and the  media
 

